
# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, lower case, no full stop, <= 72 chars>
#
# Why this change was needed. What a reviewer cannot infer from the diff:
# the undocumented endpoint, the guessed response shape, the reason the
# obvious approach didn't work.
#
# Fixes #
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# type:   feat fix perf refactor docs test build ci chore
# scope:  a provider id (claude, chatgpt, cursor, copilot, gemini, …)
#         or one of: auth brand menu settings models http project
#
# One concern per commit. Every commit should build (`make build`, `make test`).
# Imperative mood: "add", never "added" or "adds".
# Breaking changes get a `BREAKING CHANGE:` footer with the migration.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md for examples.
